    MaskPreset: {fileID: 0}
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: 'In this step, you''ll practice using Flythrough mode to zoom
      in and find a hidden number on the back of the swingset.


      In the video
      demo above, the number appears as a red square, but it will be a real number
      in your scene.


      Remember, you can always reorient yourself by double-clicking
      on a GameObject in the <b>Hierarchy</b> window.'
--- !u!114 &-5034577681123904680
